<span class="line"><span style="--shiki-light:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8;">SNC0.4   Na-high   Na-shlykovite, C-S-H       Na-shlykovite, C-S-H          Na-shlykovite, C-S-H</span></span>
